        "original_id": "3cd68a48-894c-5461-b81d-7f38a5685358",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chantal Claret, Max Green, Pedro Yanowitz\n- Bands: Morningwood, Escape the Fate, The Natural Born Killers\n- Roles: singer/songwriter, bassist, backing vocalist, rhythm guitarist, vocalist, founder\n\nFacts:\n- Chantal Claret Euringer was born on February 21, 1982, and is known professionally as Chantal Claret.\n- Max Green was born as Maxwell Scott Green on December 15, 1984, and is known professionally as Max Green.\n- Morningwood was founded in 2001 and primarily consisted of Pedro Yanowitz and Chantal Claret.\n- Chantal Claret is an American singer/songwriter.\n- Max Green is an American musician.\n- Max Green was one of the founders of Escape the Fate and served as its bassist and backing vocalist.\n- Max Green was also the former rhythm guitarist and vocalist for The Natural Born Killers.",
